reports/*
!reports/README.md
!reports/fuzzing/
reports/fuzzing/*
!reports/fuzzing/README.md
!reports/sbom/
reports/sbom/*
!reports/sbom/README.md
!reports/soak/
reports/soak/*
!reports/soak/*.md
